      "message": "[error] Line 145: 🔴 Selection state is keyed only by raw URI (`selectedContactUris`), but the list now preserves same-URI contacts across accounts (`distinctBy { accountId to uri }`). With duplicate URIs on multiple accounts, tapping one row can implicitly affect the other, and confirmation is then rejected as account-mismatched by `resolveContactPickerSelection`, leaving users unable to complete selection. Use a stable composite selection key (`accountId + uri`) end-to-end (toggle, checked rendering, chip rendering, and resolver), or strictly constrain `availableContacts` to a single picker account before any selection logic.",
